      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A huge gnarled tree, black as charcoal, with veins of red-white lightning running through split bark. Its roots end in long, jointed, spider-like legs. Thorns as long as spears jut from its branches. A hollow in the trunk glows like a furnace mouth.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.DI1nblGxCdYa2okA]{The Storm Tree}.</strong> Threshold guardian of the Whispering Wood. Warns in Sylvan through the thunder first; fights to the death with Thorn Volley, Trample and Splintering Death.</p>"
    },
